OL,3,GNEWSALeicester gets ready to celebrate
OL,4,ADiwali
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of events celebrating the
OL,7,Ftraditions and culture of Diwali will
OL,8,Ftake place across Leicester next week.
OL,10,FThe city's annual Diwali festivities -
OL,11,Famong the largest outside India - will
OL,12,Fsee the Golden Mile along Belgrave Road
OL,13,Filluminated, the return of the Wheel of
OL,14,FLight and venues hosting exhibitions,
OL,15,Fworkshops and family activities.
OL,17,FThe focus of celebrations on Diwali Day
OL,18,F- Sunday 8 November - will be at
OL,19,FCossington Recreation Ground, with live
OL,20,Fperformances including music from a
OL,21,Fworld-class philharmonic orchestra plus
OL,22,Fa suspended acrobat and laser show.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
